        "source_note": "The source fully defines one executable post-transition isothermal EOS for Pv10: a standard third-order Birch-Murnaghan pressure-volume fit to all observations above 25 GPa, with conventional Pbnm-cell V0=162.6(+/-0.3) A^3, KT0=284(+/-4) GPa, and fixed KT0'=4. The high-spin branch is discussed and was used to model the transition, but its fitted parameters are not printed and it is therefore not added.",
        "audit": "../audits/mg09fe01sio3_bridgmanite.audit.json#mg09fe01sio3_bridgmanite_mao_2015_low_spin_bm3_1"
