  "cell_contents": "Four nominal Mg0.9Fe0.1SiO3 formula units per conventional Pbnm bridgmanite cell (Z=4). The stored atom_sites are an explicitly identified MgSiO3 positional-topology proxy and do not encode the specimen's unresolved Fe2+/Fe3+ site occupancies.",
